00:35:01.230 --> 00:35:01.670
Yes.
是的。

1025
00:35:01.870 --> 00:35:03.170
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1026
00:35:03.470 --> 00:35:05.690
So we were so excited, all of us.
所以我们当时都非常兴奋。

1027
00:35:05.750 --> 00:35:07.510
I don't know if you can tell in watching the episode.
我不知道你在看这一集的时候能不能看出来。

1028
00:35:07.650 --> 00:35:10.910
But we just found out we got a job for another year.
但我们刚刚得知我们又获得了一年的工作机会。

1029
00:35:10.910 --> 00:35:14.470
That is such, that's a fast fact, Angela, right there.
安吉拉，那真是一个快速事实。

1030
00:35:14.550 --> 00:35:17.270
Oh, well, I liked your Game of Thrones fast fact.
哦，好吧，我喜欢你那个《权力的游戏》的快速事实。

1031
00:35:17.450 --> 00:35:19.290
But there, that, I guess, is a fast fact.
但那个，我想，也算是一个快速事实吧。

1032
00:35:19.450 --> 00:35:21.690
Also, I said that we're just so excited.
另外，我说过我们当时真的太兴奋了。

1033
00:35:21.850 --> 00:35:22.830
We're really proud of the show.
我们真的为这部剧感到自豪。

1034
00:35:22.990 --> 00:35:24.270
We're so excited to get a third year.
我们非常高兴能有第三年的拍摄机会。

1035
00:35:24.550 --> 00:35:31.810
I said this week, also, we had a photographer from NBC taking official photos for the website for Valentine's Day.
我还写道，这周NBC的一位摄影师来为情人节拍摄官方宣传照。

1036
00:35:32.290 --> 00:35:33.830
I remember those photos.
我记得那些照片。

1037
00:35:34.030 --> 00:35:42.110
These are sort of some iconic photos that are out there on the internet of, like, Steve holding up a heart and Kate Flannery and you and me and Phyllis all surrounding him.
那些照片在网上很有标志性，比如史蒂夫举着一颗心，凯特·弗兰纳里、你、我和菲利斯都围在他身边。

1038
00:35:42.590 --> 00:35:44.230
So there's some great Valentine shot.
所以有一些很棒的情人节照片。

1039
00:35:44.410 --> 00:35:47.230
There's one of, like, Dwight and I side by side.
有一张是德怀特和我并排站着的。

1040
00:35:47.550 --> 00:35:53.230
I did some photos with David Denman as Roy, so some Pam and Roy Valentine shots as well.
我还和大卫·丹曼拍了一些照片，他是演罗伊的，所以也有一些帕姆和罗伊的情人节合影。

1041
00:35:53.410 --> 00:35:59.990
And I also wrote, this was the first time the supporting cast were included in one of these big photo shoots, and we were all so excited.
我还写道，这是配角们第一次被纳入这种大型拍摄活动，我们都非常兴奋。

1042
00:36:00.550 --> 00:36:01.510
I remember that.
我记得那件事。

1043
00:36:01.510 --> 00:36:06.110
Because we weren't series regular the last time we did them, but now we were, and we got to be in the pictures.
因为上次拍摄时我们还不是常规演员，但现在我们是了，所以我们能参与拍摄。

1044
00:36:06.350 --> 00:36:10.430
And I said, of course, I had the biggest zit since I've had since high school.
我还说，当然，我长了自高中以来最大的一个痘痘。

1045
00:36:10.610 --> 00:36:11.970
Yeah, that always happens.
是啊，那种事总是会发生。

1046
00:36:12.310 --> 00:36:13.730
They probably photoshopped them out, though.
不过他们可能会用修图软件把它修掉。

1047
00:36:13.730 --> 00:36:15.630
I said, I hope they'll photoshop it out.
我说，我希望他们能把它修掉。

1048
00:36:15.630 --> 00:36:16.630
See, look at that.
你看，瞧瞧那个。

1049
00:36:16.750 --> 00:36:17.410
Like I said.
就像我说的。

1050
00:36:17.510 --> 00:36:17.890
I know.
我知道。

1051
00:36:18.330 --> 00:36:23.350
Anyway, those are – oh, and then I wrote, and this is before, you know, obviously we ever knew we'd do this podcaSt.
总之，那些是——噢，还有我当时写的，这显然是在我们知道会做这个播客之前。

1052
00:36:23.350 --> 00:36:28.410
We ever knew that we'd be tracking the Mindy of it all, and this is what I wrote in 2006.
我们当时根本不知道会去追踪关于明迪的一切，这是我在2006年写下的内容。

1053
00:36:29.130 --> 00:36:35.210
Okay, if you're a Kelly fan, you will love this episode, and Mindy, who plays Kelly, does a great job.
好吧，如果你是凯利的粉丝，你会喜欢这一集的，饰演凯利的明迪表现得非常棒。

1054
00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:36.210
Hey!
