1055
00:36:37.110 --> 00:36:38.410
Even you knew.
连你都知道。

1056
00:36:38.630 --> 00:36:38.890
Even –
连——

1057
00:36:38.890 --> 00:36:42.110
Something special is happening with the character of Kelly in the carpet.
地毯里的凯利这个角色正在发生一些特别的事情。

1058
00:36:42.650 --> 00:36:47.250
2006 me knew that Kelly was maybe Kelly, was maybe Mindy.
2006年的我知道凯利可能就是凯利，可能就是明迪。

1059
00:36:48.210 --> 00:36:49.550
All right, let's take a break.
好了，我们休息一下。

1060
00:36:49.550 --> 00:36:50.490
We'll be back in a sec.
马上回来。

1061
00:36:50.750 --> 00:36:58.810
