但到了13分12秒，镜头透过迈克尔办公室的百叶窗拍到他们，他们正在喝啤酒，而且好像在睡觉。

1067
00:37:21.270 --> 00:37:24.270
They're sleeping on the rolled-up carpet that they just removed.
他们睡在刚刚拆下来的卷好的地毯上。

1068
00:37:24.410 --> 00:37:25.730
They're using it as a headreSt.
他们把它当成了枕头。

1069
00:37:25.850 --> 00:37:26.010
Yeah.
是啊。

1070
00:37:26.150 --> 00:37:26.730
Well, there's a –
嗯，有个——

1071
00:37:26.730 --> 00:37:27.270
Continuity catch.
连贯性错误。

1072
00:37:27.450 --> 00:37:27.950
Well, I –
嗯，我——

1073
00:37:27.950 --> 00:37:30.390
Unless – is that the new carpet they haven't put down yet?
除非——那是他们还没铺上去的新地毯吗？

1074
00:37:30.390 --> 00:37:37.150
I don't know, but there is a whole deleted scene of just Daryl and Roy just being idiots in that room.
我不知道，但有一整段删减片段，就是达里尔和罗伊在那间屋子里犯傻。

1075
00:37:37.350 --> 00:37:44.570
There's a whole scene where they are drinking beers, and they have two, like, rubber balls, and they're bouncing them against the wall like they've got a game going.
有一整段戏是他们在那儿喝啤酒，拿着两个橡胶球，像玩游戏一样对着墙壁拍打。

1076
00:37:44.730 --> 00:37:44.950
Yeah.
是啊。

1077
00:37:45.370 --> 00:37:49.590
So, there were things cut out of this episode of them messing around in there.
所以，这一集里确实剪掉了一些他们在里面胡闹的镜头。

1078
00:37:49.830 --> 00:37:52.910
Well, I suppose it could be the carpet they haven't installed yet.
嗯，我想那可能是他们还没安装的地毯。

1079
00:37:53.070 --> 00:37:53.450
Maybe.
也许吧。

1080
00:37:53.750 --> 00:37:54.490
Maybe, Jenna.
也许吧，珍娜。

1081
00:37:54.770 --> 00:37:59.030
At 13 minutes, 56 seconds, I declare Michael Sass.
在13分56秒，我宣布迈克尔“毒舌”。

1082
00:37:59.310 --> 00:38:00.170
Michael Sass?
迈克尔“毒舌”？

1083
00:38:00.170 --> 00:38:00.810
Let's hear it.
说来听听。

1084
00:38:00.970 --> 00:38:03.950
Well, Pam says stopping the sales contest isn't fair.
嗯，帕姆说取消销售竞赛不公平。

1085
00:38:04.190 --> 00:38:07.590
I guess we should say Michael gets upset, and he stops his sales conteSt.
我想我们应该说迈克尔生气了，然后他取消了他的销售竞赛。

1086
00:38:07.830 --> 00:38:09.450
No one can win $83 anymore.
没人能再赢得那83美元了。

1087
00:38:09.690 --> 00:38:10.670
He's just being a brat.
他就是在耍小孩子脾气。

1088
00:38:10.910 --> 00:38:12.930
But Michael gives it right back to Pam.
但迈克尔立刻回击了帕姆。

1089
00:38:13.670 --> 00:38:14.130
Oh, yeah?
噢，是吗？

1090
00:38:14.390 --> 00:38:14.670
Yeah.
是的。

1091
00:38:14.970 --> 00:38:19.750
I didn't write down what he said, but you can look it up at 13 minutes, 56 seconds if you want.
我没记下他说了什么，但如果你想知道，可以在13分56秒处自己去查。

1092
00:38:19.870 --> 00:38:22.050
That sort of takes the wind out of here.
这有点让人泄气。

1093
00:38:22.050 --> 00:38:22.470
It does.
确实。

1094
00:38:22.570 --> 00:38:28.410
I realized as I was looking at my sheet, I was like, wow, that was an incomplete – I did not complete that question of my homework.
我看着笔记时才意识到，哇，那是个未完成的——我的作业没写完。

1095
00:38:28.410 --> 00:38:30.030
Well, I will say this.
好吧，我得说这个。

1096
00:38:30.170 --> 00:38:31.670
My sister and I laughed, actually.
其实我和我姐姐都笑了。

1097
00:38:31.830 --> 00:38:32.730
She's a school teacher.
她是名学校老师。

1098
00:38:32.730 --> 00:38:33.990
She teaches pre-K.
她教幼儿园学前班。

1099
00:38:34.330 --> 00:38:38.810
And at 14 minutes, 26 seconds, Michael puts the whole office in time out.
在14分26秒，迈克尔让整个办公室的人都去“面壁思过”。

1100
00:38:38.990 --> 00:38:39.650
Oh, yes.
噢，没错。

1101
00:38:40.050 --> 00:38:41.030
Oh, yes.
噢，是的。

1102
00:38:41.630 --> 00:38:42.150
Anyway.
总之。

1103
00:38:42.490 --> 00:38:42.730
Okay.
好吧。

1104
00:38:43.650 --> 00:38:49.170
So then we have the scene in the kitchen with Jim and Ryan, and Jim asks Ryan what he thinks of Kelly.
接下来是吉姆和瑞安在厨房的那场戏，吉姆问瑞安觉得凯莉怎么样。

1105
00:38:49.430 --> 00:38:52.710
He's trying to help Kelly out because she's begged him.
他是在帮凯莉的忙，因为她求过他。

1106
00:38:52.850 --> 00:38:56.810
Well, this also just shows where he's at in his day because at first he doesn't want to help her.
嗯，这也体现了他当时的状态，因为起初他并不想帮她。

1107
00:38:56.910 --> 00:38:58.450
He's like, I'm not getting in the middle of those two.
他当时的态度是，我才不想卷进他们俩中间。

1108
00:38:58.590 --> 00:39:03.290
And then by the end of the day, he's like, fine, I'll be your go-between because he doesn't have his buddy.
但到了那天结束时，他又说，好吧，我来当你们的传话筒，因为他身边没有好哥们。

1109
