He doesn't have Pam to, like, help the day pass.
他没有帕姆来帮他打发时间。

1110
00:39:05.450 --> 00:39:07.110
Well, we had a fan question.
嗯，我们收到一个粉丝提问。

1111
00:39:07.430 --> 00:39:07.970
Maddie W.
麦迪·W。

1112
