00:39:14.390 --> 00:39:15.550
What do you think, Ange?
你觉得呢，安吉？

1114
00:39:15.590 --> 00:39:16.730
I think it was Mindy's.
我觉得是敏迪的主意。

1115
00:39:17.730 --> 00:39:18.650
I don't know.
我不知道。

1116
00:39:18.830 --> 00:39:21.530
I was going to text her, but she had the Oscars and she was presenting.
我本来想给她发短信，但那天正好是奥斯卡颁奖礼，她还要上台颁奖。

1117
00:39:21.710 --> 00:39:22.430
I didn't want to bug her.
我不想打扰她。

1118
00:39:22.430 --> 00:39:29.050
Yeah, we were prepping this episode the weekend of Oscars weekend, and Mindy was a presenter.
没错，我们准备这一集的时候正好是奥斯卡周末，敏迪是颁奖嘉宾。

1119
00:39:29.290 --> 00:39:33.850
And can we talk for one second about how amazing she looked in her dress?
我们能花一秒钟感叹一下她穿那件礼服有多美吗？

1120
00:39:34.110 --> 00:39:35.150
She looked amazing.
她看起来太棒了。

1121
00:39:35.150 --> 00:39:39.270
I actually did text her and BJ the next day, and I was like, you guys look so beautiful together.
其实第二天我给敏迪和BJ发了短信，我说，你们俩看起来真是太般配了。

1122
00:39:39.450 --> 00:39:39.610
Yeah.
是啊。

1123
00:39:39.870 --> 00:39:41.810
And she wrote back, Ange, I love this.
她回我说，安吉，我太喜欢这个了。

1124
00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:42.310
Thank you.
谢谢你。

1125
00:39:42.530 --> 00:39:43.310
Well, there you go.
你看，就是这样。

1126
00:39:43.570 --> 00:39:45.390
Kelly and Ryan went to the Oscars together.
凯莉和瑞安一起去了奥斯卡。

1127
00:39:45.590 --> 00:39:47.570
Well, they're very, very dear friends.
嗯，他们是非常非常亲密的朋友。

1128
00:39:47.610 --> 00:39:48.270
They're best friends.
他们是最好的朋友。

1129
00:39:48.310 --> 00:39:48.970
They're best friends.
他们是最好的朋友。

1130
00:39:49.010 --> 00:39:51.470
There were a lot of friendships that came out of our show.
我们的剧组里诞生了很多友谊。

1131
00:39:51.470 --> 00:39:52.790
There was our best friendship.
有我们之间的挚友关系。

1132
00:39:53.030 --> 00:39:54.230
There was their best friendship.
也有他们之间的挚友关系。

1133
00:39:54.550 --> 00:39:56.930
Well, all of the guys still play fantasy football together.
嗯，所有的男演员现在还会一起玩梦幻足球。

1134
00:39:57.130 --> 00:39:57.750
That's true.
那是真的。

1135
00:39:57.770 --> 00:39:58.910
All the guys, every year.
所有的男演员，每年都玩。

1136
00:39:59.290 --> 00:39:59.910
All right.
好吧。

1137
00:40:00.070 --> 00:40:01.210
So where are we at, Jenna?
那么我们讲到哪了，珍娜？

1138
00:40:02.210 --> 00:40:09.330
So next, Michael talks to Creed about his fear of becoming Ed Truck.
接下来，迈克尔和克里德谈到了他害怕自己会变成埃德·特拉克。

1139
00:40:09.430 --> 00:40:11.490
Oh, this scene is so funny.
噢，这场戏太搞笑了。

1140
00:40:11.790 --> 00:40:13.650
Creed made me laugh so hard in this scene.
克里德在这场戏里把我逗得大笑不止。

1141
00:40:13.730 --> 00:40:13.990
Yeah.
是啊。

1142
00:40:14.170 --> 00:40:17.150
He's like, Michael, you have a lot more to be worried about than that.
他说，迈克尔，你该担心的事可不止这一件。

1143
00:40:17.290 --> 00:40:18.430
He's like, oh, great.
迈克尔说，噢，太好了。

1144
00:40:18.550 --> 00:40:19.050
Thanks, Creed.
谢了，克里德。

1145
00:40:19.190 --> 00:40:20.190
I guess being buried alive.
我想是被活埋吧。

1146
00:40:20.190 --> 00:40:21.610
Why am I even talking to you?
我为什么要跟你说这些？

1147
00:40:22.250 --> 00:40:25.250
And then we go outside and we meet Ed Truck.
然后我们来到外面，见到了埃德·特拉克。

1148
00:40:25.590 --> 00:40:33.090
And this scene, oh, it broke my heart because in the scene, Ed says, Michael, why can't your
这场戏，噢，它让我心碎，因为在戏里，埃德说，迈克尔，为什么你的

1149
00:40:33.090 --> 00:40:37.550
workers be your workers, your family be your family, and your friends be your friends?
员工不能只是员工，家人不能只是家人，朋友不能只是朋友呢？

1150
00:40:37.550 --> 00:40:41.170
And you can see they hold on Michael's face.
你可以看到镜头一直停在迈克尔的脸上。

1151
00:40:41.290 --> 00:40:47.110
And you can see that the reason why is because he doesn't have friends and family.
你可以看出原因所在，因为他没有朋友和家人。

1152
