He needs his workers to be all three things.
他需要他的员工同时具备这三点。

1153
00:40:50.510 --> 00:40:53.330
He doesn't have those compartments in his life.
他的生活中没有这些分类。

1154
00:40:53.650 --> 00:40:54.210
No, he doesn't.
不，他没有。

1155
00:40:54.390 --> 00:40:56.110
And it breaks your heart.
